  "published": "2026-10-16T16:09:58.887Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.4: two field-reported descriptor divergences from MAME fixed. (1) Redump multi-cue Dreamcast cues (REM SINGLE-DENSITY/HIGH-DENSITY AREA, is_gdicue) now get the full GD-ROM layout - pregaps move onto the previous track as split regions, the last single-density track pads up to LBA 45000, CHGD metadata is written - verified byte-identical to chdman createcd on a real 1.19 GB sample with a byte-perfect extractcd round-trip. (2) A bare cdrdao TOC `START` line is accepted as \"no pregap\" (MAME's parse_toc treats the missing time as 0), where it previously failed with `Malformed START command`; byte parity pinned by tests. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
